{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06367","headline":"临别送张諲入蜀 · 李颀","name":"临别送张諲入蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出门便爲客，惘然悲徒御。\n四海维一身，茫茫欲何去？\n经山复历水，百恨将千虑。\n劒阁望梁州，是君断肠处。\n孤云伤客心，落日感君深。\n梦里蒹葭渚，天边橘柚林。\n蜀江流不测，蜀路险难寻。\n木有相思号，猿多愁苦音。\n莫向愚山隐，愚山地非近。\n故乡可归来，眼见芳菲尽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}